WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:04.930
Roxy arrived at the Mighty Man TV studio.

2
00:00:04.931 --> 00:00:10.064
"Yikes!" she thought, noticing deep slash marks in the walls and curtains.

3
00:00:10.065 --> 00:00:12.364
Broken TV equipment lay on the floor.

4
00:00:12.365 --> 00:00:14.945
Detective Smith was talking with the director.

5
00:00:14.946 --> 00:00:17.507
The Mighty Man actor was with them.

6
00:00:17.508 --> 00:00:20.442
"Watch out, Mighty Man," Roxy said.

7
00:00:20.443 --> 00:00:23.413
"It's Grumpy Detective Man!"

8
00:00:23.414 --> 00:00:25.069
Detective Smith frowned.

9
00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:28.390
"I'm not a villain, Rocket Girl.

10
00:00:28.391 --> 00:00:32.310
And I'm grumpy because there's a supervillain on the loose."

11
00:00:32.311 --> 00:00:33.839
The director nodded.

12
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:36.248
"This guy was very upset.

13
00:00:36.249 --> 00:00:39.045
He calls himself Darklight Man.

14
00:00:39.046 --> 00:00:42.984
He wants to be a TV villain, even though he can't act."

15
00:00:42.985 --> 00:00:45.017
The Mighty Man actor bit his lip.

16
00:00:45.018 --> 00:00:48.037
"Rocket Girl, you have to protect me.

17
00:00:48.038 --> 00:00:50.591
Darklight Man wants to hurt me!"

18
00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:55.204
Creeaak! Suddenly a loud noise shook the building.

19
00:00:55.205 --> 00:00:57.168
Roxy flew outside.

20
00:00:57.169 --> 00:01:00.069
She saw a man in a dark cape on the roof.

21
00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:03.431
He was swinging a light sword at a tall broadcast tower.

22
00:01:03.432 --> 00:01:06.162
"It's Darklight Man!" Roxy thought.

23
00:01:06.163 --> 00:01:08.798
"He's trying to cut down that tower!"

24
00:01:08.799 --> 00:01:13.684
Creeeaak! The tower tilted as Darklight Man sliced a metal beam.

25
00:01:13.685 --> 00:01:16.314
"Stop that!" Roxy yelled.

26
00:01:16.315 --> 00:01:18.317
Darklight Man spun around.

27
00:01:18.318 --> 00:01:19.978
"Stay back, Rocket Girl.

28
00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:23.522
I'm about to ruin the Mighty Man show forever!"

29
00:01:23.523 --> 00:01:30.354
"Why are you so mad at Mighty Man?" Roxy asked.

30
00:01:30.355 --> 00:01:32.575
Darklight Man's eyes flashed.

31
00:01:32.576 --> 00:01:34.972
"I'm a genius and a supervillain.

32
00:01:34.973 --> 00:01:38.682
But they said I wasn't good enough to be on TV.

33
00:01:38.683 --> 00:01:44.727
Well, I'll show them—with this light sword that I invented myself!"

34
00:01:44.728 --> 00:01:47.531
He was about to slice another beam.

35
00:01:47.532 --> 00:01:52.131
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams at his sword.

36
00:01:52.132 --> 00:01:55.248
Darklight Man blocked the beams with the sword.

37
00:01:55.249 --> 00:01:59.923
"Grr!" Roxy thought. "I have to try something else!"

38
00:01:59.924 --> 00:02:02.396
She took a deep breath and blew out hard.

39
00:02:02.397 --> 00:02:04.941
A powerful gust hit the light sword.

40
00:02:04.942 --> 00:02:06.824
But the villain held on tightly.

41
00:02:06.825 --> 00:02:10.298
He pushed a button to make the light sword's blade retract.

42
00:02:10.299 --> 00:02:12.155
Roxy blew harder.

43
00:02:12.156 --> 00:02:15.591
This time Darklight Man lost his grip on the sword.

44
00:02:15.592 --> 00:02:17.866
"Yes!" Roxy thought.

45
00:02:17.867 --> 00:02:20.956
Clunk! The metal handle hit the roof.

46
00:02:20.957 --> 00:02:23.775
It started to roll toward the edge of the tower.

47
00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:27.020
But Darklight Man dived for it.

48
00:02:27.021 --> 00:02:29.363
"Ha! Got it, Rocket Girl!

49
00:02:29.364 --> 00:02:32.888
It will take more than your super breath to stop me."

50
00:02:32.889 --> 00:02:35.558
He climbed to his feet and pushed the button again.

51
00:02:35.559 --> 00:02:37.311
The blade reappeared.

52
00:02:37.312 --> 00:02:40.642
Then Darklight Man slashed at the tower again.

53
00:02:40.643 --> 00:02:42.177
Creeaak!

54
00:02:42.178 --> 00:02:46.157
Roxy gasped as the huge tower began to topple.

55
00:02:46.158 --> 00:02:52.868
"Oh no!" she thought. "It's going to crash down to the street!"

